{"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Migrating from Nested Hosts to `FlowHost`","modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterTesting"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting"],["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterSwiftUI\/InnoRouterSwiftUI"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Starting point","type":"heading","anchor":"Starting-point","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An app that shipped before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowStore"},{"type":"text","text":" landed typically has:"}]},{"syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment","type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct LegacyApp: App {","    @State private var nav = NavigationStore<AppRoute>()","    @State private var modal = ModalStore<AppRoute>()","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ModalHost(store: modal, destination: destination) {","                NavigationHost(store: nav, destination: destination) {","                    RootView()","                }","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two stores. Two hosts. Path + modal state cannot be round-tripped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as one value — the app can’t persist “user is 3 screens deep"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inside a presented sheet” without hand-serializing both halves."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Target shape","anchor":"Target-shape"},{"syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment","type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct MigratedApp: App {","    @State private var flow = FlowStore<AppRoute>()","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            FlowHost(","      